    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shroomer</strong> is a relaxed open-world VR fantasy where you play as a mystical <strong>mushroom forager,</strong> entrusted by the kingdom to manage a secret enchanted forest.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather rare fungi and magical vegetation, <strong>process them into powerful elixirs</strong>, and complete unique quests for the kingdom and its inhabitants. But beware\u2014<strong>some mushrooms are volatile, capable of exploding, releasing toxic spores, or reacting in unpredictable ways.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use tools, knowledge, and alchemy to safely harvest and prepare ingredients. <strong>Build and upgrade crafting stations</strong> to cook shrooms and brew <strong>elixirs that unlock new abilities</strong> and paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests</strong> vary in <strong>timing</strong> and complexity\u2014some must be completed before time runs out, while others are only available at night. <strong>Learn where and when different mushrooms grow.</strong> Real-world foraging experience will help you early on, but the forest has its own mysterious species you'll need to learn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore biomes</strong>, discover hidden magic, and immerse yourself in the unique game atmosphere. Your choices shape your journey\u2014and the forest is watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Will you become a master of shroomcraft, or will the forest claim you?</strong></i></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shroomer</strong> is a relaxed open-world VR fantasy where you play as a mystical <strong>mushroom forager,</strong> entrusted by the kingdom to manage a secret enchanted forest.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather rare fungi and magical vegetation, <strong>process them into powerful elixirs</strong>, and complete unique quests for the kingdom and its inhabitants. But beware\u2014<strong>some mushrooms are volatile, capable of exploding, releasing toxic spores, or reacting in unpredictable ways.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use tools, knowledge, and alchemy to safely harvest and prepare ingredients. <strong>Build and upgrade crafting stations</strong> to cook shrooms and brew <strong>elixirs that unlock new abilities</strong> and paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests</strong> vary in <strong>timing</strong> and complexity\u2014some must be completed before time runs out, while others are only available at night. <strong>Learn where and when different mushrooms grow.</strong> Real-world foraging experience will help you early on, but the forest has its own mysterious species you'll need to learn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore biomes</strong>, discover hidden magic, and immerse yourself in the unique game atmosphere. Your choices shape your journey\u2014and the forest is watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Will you become a master of shroomcraft, or will the forest claim you?</strong></i></h2>",
    "short_description": "In this open-world relaxed VR fantasy, you are Shroomer, a mystical forager tasked with managing a secret enchanted forest. Gather rare fungi and vegetation, craft elixirs, build tools and complete tasks. Handle dangerous mushrooms with special approach or risk being claimed by the forest\u2019s magic.",
